# cross-lib-decision-split — Lib B (the SHARED, AUTO-SPLIT decision library).
library "Shared".

// Shared has concept-level `code is` (LocalSource) AND a decision, so
// `computeSplitPlan` returns `interface`: emit fans it into policy-id-named
// layer libraries (`<policyId>-LocalSource`, `<policyId>-Interface`, ...) and
// the SOURCE name `Shared` no longer exists as an emitted CQL library.
//
// Root delegates to this decision via `use decision "Shared"."Sub Triage"`.

concept "Active Severe Crohns":
- type is Condition.
- value type is boolean.
- code is `active-severe-crohns`.
- definition is exists this.

activity "Shared Deny":
- request CPGCommunicationRequest.
- with `Denied.`.

decision "Sub Triage":
- when "Active Severe Crohns" then recommend activity "Shared Deny".
